# YouTube

Use both skills when the user wants to watch a video.

- Transcript / search / channel / playlist: `.cursor/skills/youtube-full/SKILL.md` (TranscriptAPI, no yt-dlp)
- Visual frames: `.cursor/skills/youtube-watch/SKILL.md` or `~/.cursor/skills/youtube-watch/`

```bash
~/.cursor/skills/youtube-watch/.venv/bin/python \
  ~/.cursor/skills/youtube-watch/scripts/watch_youtube.py \
  "URL" --interval 5 --analyze
```
